What Do Car Polishing Services Actually Do?
A machine polisher and compound wear away a very thin layer of clear coat while smoothing out whatever imperfections sit on the surface. That's the process behind restoring the shine and clarity that fades with everyday driving.
Removes light scratches, swirl marks, and oxidation
Smooths out the paint surface for a more even finish
Restores gloss and depth that fades with age and exposure
