Car Paint Restoration: When Polishing Won't Solve It
Car paint restoration comes into play when paint damage goes beyond what standard polishing or correction can fix. This is common on older vehicles or ones that haven't been maintained for a long time.
Addresses heavy fading, deep oxidation, or long-neglected paint
May involve more aggressive compounding before finishing
Aims to bring severely worn paint as close to its original condition as possible
How Polishing Works Into Full Car Exterior Detailing
